l stains, dish soap + baking soda makes an easy stain-fighting paste. Steam is one of my favorite ways to tackle stubborn messes on the stove with less effort, and baking soda is such an easy way to refresh rugs and carpets. And for softer, fresher towels, try swapping your usual fabric softener for white vinegar to help avoid buildup.\n\nSave this one for your next cleaning day! \ud83e\uddfc\n\n#CleaningHacks #CleaningTips #CleanSmarter #HouseholdHacks #HomeHacksWithCarolina ", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T11:08:35.000Z", "videoDuration": 25, "videoPlayCount": 6932, "likesCount": 210, "commentsCount": 1, "displayUrl": "https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-p-0037/oYP0DOwZ0iRbMbC1AcIMIhImfICihAAq7B0IUi~tplv-tiktokx-origin.image?dr=9636&x-expires=1790085600&x-signature=%2BZ57QqsHVeAEbyFuvoA4ZZ0TvD0%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=81f88b70&shcp=43f4a2f9&idc=useast5", "ownerUsername": "carolina.mccauley", "ownerFullName": "Carolina Mccauley - Home Hacks", "platform": "tiktok", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-13", "plays": 5399, "likes": 158, "comments": 1}, {"date": "2026-09-20", "plays": 6932, "likes": 210, "comments": 1}], "still_climbing": false, "videoUrl": "https://api.apify.com/v2/key-value-stores/h725drifymrL5bg98/records/video-carolinamc-20260913110835-7684975119344749831.mp4", "is_relevant": true}, {"shortCode": "7684270739725339911", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@carolina.mccauley/video/7684270739725339911", "caption": "How to keep your towels soft, fluffy and fresh \ud83e\uddfa\u2728\n\nWash towels in their own load, add baking soda to help freshen them, and swap fabric softener for white vinegar. Go easy on detergent too \u2014 too much can leave residue behind, so use the right amount and a good-quality detergent.\n\nWash warm, tumble dry on low, and make sure towels are fully dry before storing. I also like washing bath towels every 3\u20134 uses to keep them fresh.\n\n#LaundryTips #TowelCare #CleaningTips #LaundryHacks #HomeHacksWithCarolina ", "t